#Farntry Isle

## Map

![FarntryMap](/images/Farntry_Isle.png)

> Farntry Isle is the southern halfe-isle of [Calanthia](/src/calanthia). It belongs to the kingdoms of [Ehrsburg](/src/ehrsburg) being divided by the geographic line between the northern forest and the southern desert.
> The island of Farntry is connected over land to [Calanthia](/src/calanthia) via [Rhein](/src/rhein) and over water to [Kházdûral Havn](/src/khazdural_havn) via [Berwihl](/src/berwihl).


